                <head>No. 1163<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Telegram 2423, May 13, personal for Acting Secretary Smith from Dulles in
                    Cairo, reported on discussions between British and Egyptian officials. For text,
                    see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v09p1/d7">Document 7</ref>.</p>
